  step=2,dige:15c959aa0f0f1e87,desc:seed eight sibling cogs — four brass four iron and unique teeth
  step=3,dige:3f6e42110cf9f73c,desc:mint A:Vyto beside the run and commission it on the eight cogs
    Assertion:the-glass-was-commissioned,sentence:the glass was commissioned on eight sibling cogs and stood its board
  step=4,dige:ffc6d5b282c87b31,desc:stir to rest — gang elects its key and relate weaves the edges
    Assertion:the-gang-organ-elected,sentence:the gang organ elected metal — the one key that cleaves eight cogs into brass and iron
    Assertion:the-relate-organ-wove,sentence:the relate organ wove twelve flow edges — every pair sharing a metal and none that do not
  step=5,dige:b9a0cec389e50eea,desc:propose focus on one cog through the governor door
    Assertion:the-focus-governor-swelled,sentence:the focus governor swelled the chosen cog to dominance — attention became geometry
  step=6,dige:a80bd8f2dfc17e24,desc:release the focus — the governor stands down and the cut evens
